# Keep the Python Function bundle small - it has a 500MB limit, and
# vercel.json's includeFiles pulls in backend/**, so anything heavy that lands
# under backend/ locally (a virtualenv, caches) would otherwise ship with it.
#
# Only affects what gets uploaded/bundled. The frontend is still built on
# Vercel by vercel.json's buildCommand, which runs its own npm install.
.venv/
backend/.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
node_modules/
frontend/dist/
backend/data/results/
backend/data/ffb.db
.git/
